{
  "schemaVersion": "1.0",
  "id": "e-take-place",
  "lexicon": "zkv",
  "number": 314,
  "kind": "phrase",
  "headword": "take place",
  "star": true,
  "senses": [
    {
      "zh": "发生；举行"
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "The accident "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "took place"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " on the fifth day of their journey."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "事故发生在他们旅程的第五天。"
    },
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Most people were sleeping when the big earthquake "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "took place"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " in that area."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "大地震发生时，那个地区的大部分人正在睡梦中。"
    }
  ],
  "tip": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "take place 是常考词组，常出现在保持句意基本不变的句型转换练习中，所以学生一定要知道：take place 与 happen（没有被动语态）和 be held 意思相同，在句中可以互换。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如：As we all know, the next Olympic Games will "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "take place"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " in Los Angeles."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "= As we all know, the next Olympic Games will "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "be held"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " in Los Angeles."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "我们都知道，下届奥运会将在洛杉矶举行。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "I was told that the car accident "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "took place"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " this morning."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "= I was told that the car accident "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "happened"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " this morning."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "有人告诉我，今天早上发生了一起车祸。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
